---
// Every post announcing an event (flyers and videos), in a sheet, like Airbnb's "show all photos": from a card's
// "▦ 16", the details' "Ver las 16 publicaciones", or the badge on an event page's flyer. Filled by
// scripts/views/postsSheet.ts. Used by the home page (over the list or the details drawer) and by each event's page.
---

<dialog class="sheet sheet-panel posts-sheet" id="posts-sheet" aria-labelledby="posts-sheet-title">
  <span class="sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="sheet-panel__head">
    <h2 class="sheet-panel__title" id="posts-sheet-title">Publicaciones</h2>
    <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-close-sheet aria-label="Cerrar">×</button>
  </div>
  <div id="posts-sheet-body"></div>
</dialog>
